      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AgentRunRegistry  ·  runtime/AgentRunRegistry.ts\n\nprivate activeRuns = new Map<string, AbortController>();\n\nstart(projectId) {\n  const controller = new AbortController();\n  this.activeRuns.set(projectId, controller);\n  return controller;\n}\n\nstop(projectId) {\n  this.activeRuns.get(projectId)\n    ?.abort(new AgentRunCancelledError());\n}\n\nprojectId selects the controller;\nthe exact signal is passed down the run.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AgentRunRegistry  ·  runtime/AgentRunRegistry.ts\n\nprivate activeRuns = new Map<string, AbortController>();\n\nstart(projectId) {\n  const controller = new AbortController();\n  this.activeRuns.set(projectId, controller);\n  return controller;\n}\n\nstop(projectId) {\n  this.activeRuns.get(projectId)\n    ?.abort(new AgentRunCancelledError());\n}\n\nprojectId selects the controller;\nthe exact signal is passed down the run.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
