      "text": "fingerprintWorkspace()  ·  runtime/workspaceFingerprint.ts\n\nconst hash = createHash(\"sha256\");\n\nfor every sorted source entry:\n  hash.update(\"file\\0\" + relativePath + \"\\0\");\n  hash.update(await readFile(absolutePath));\n\nexclude:\n  .git, node_modules, dist, build,\n  .cache, .vite, coverage\n\nreturn hash.digest(\"hex\");\n\nUsed before and after the main run to prove a net\nsource-workspace change, not just trust tool metadata.",
