      "locked": false,
      "text": "createGeminiGenerationConfig()  ·  providers/geminiConfig.ts\n\nconst allowedFunctionNames = declarations\n  .filter(name => implementationToolNames.has(name));\n\nconst force =\n  args.forceImplementationToolCall === true\n  && allowedFunctionNames.length > 0;\n\nreturn {\n  systemInstruction,\n  tools: [{ functionDeclarations }],\n  toolConfig: {\n    functionCallingConfig: {\n      mode: force\n        ? FunctionCallingConfigMode.ANY\n        : FunctionCallingConfigMode.AUTO,\n      ...(force && { allowedFunctionNames })\n    }\n  },\n  ...(abortSignal && { abortSignal })\n};\n\nAUTO normally; ANY only after a rejected no-change\nimplementation response.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "createGeminiGenerationConfig()  ·  providers/geminiConfig.ts\n\nconst allowedFunctionNames = declarations\n  .filter(name => implementationToolNames.has(name));\n\nconst force =\n  args.forceImplementationToolCall === true\n  && allowedFunctionNames.length > 0;\n\nreturn {\n  systemInstruction,\n  tools: [{ functionDeclarations }],\n  toolConfig: {\n    functionCallingConfig: {\n      mode: force\n        ? FunctionCallingConfigMode.ANY\n        : FunctionCallingConfigMode.AUTO,\n      ...(force && { allowedFunctionNames })\n    }\n  },\n  ...(abortSignal && { abortSignal })\n};\n\nAUTO normally; ANY only after a rejected no-change\nimplementation response.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
