      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "File tools  ·  tools/file.ts\n\nresolveWorkspacePath(cwd, relativePath)\n  → rejects paths escaping project root\n\nupdateFile:\nif (typeof content === \"string\") {\n  writeFileSync(filePath, content);\n  return {\n    response: \"Wrote ... characters\",\n    effects: {\n      workspaceChanged: true,\n      runtimeMayChange: true\n    }\n  };\n}\n\noldString/newString mode:\n  requires exactly one occurrence,\n  otherwise returns an error without effects.",
      "fontSize": 15,
