      "locked": false,
      "text": "executeBash  ·  tools/bash.ts\n              → runtime/executeInWorkspace.ts\n\nReject foreground npm/vite servers.\n\nresult = await executeInWorkspace(fullCommand, {\n  databaseProjectId,\n  namespace,\n  containerName: \"node\",\n  workingDirectory,\n  signal\n});\n\nexecuteInWorkspace:\n  find Running pod by app=<runtimeId>-workspace\n  Bun.spawn([\n    \"kubectl\", \"exec\", pod, \"--container\", \"node\",\n    \"--\", \"/bin/sh\", \"-lc\", command\n  ]);\n\nsignal.addEventListener(\"abort\",\n  () => child.kill(\"SIGTERM\"));\n\neffects come from expectedImpact;\nfinal filesystem fingerprint confirms net mutation.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "executeBash  ·  tools/bash.ts\n              → runtime/executeInWorkspace.ts\n\nReject foreground npm/vite servers.\n\nresult = await executeInWorkspace(fullCommand, {\n  databaseProjectId,\n  namespace,\n  containerName: \"node\",\n  workingDirectory,\n  signal\n});\n\nexecuteInWorkspace:\n  find Running pod by app=<runtimeId>-workspace\n  Bun.spawn([\n    \"kubectl\", \"exec\", pod, \"--container\", \"node\",\n    \"--\", \"/bin/sh\", \"-lc\", command\n  ]);\n\nsignal.addEventListener(\"abort\",\n  () => child.kill(\"SIGTERM\"));\n\neffects come from expectedImpact;\nfinal filesystem fingerprint confirms net mutation.",
