      "text": "observeRuntime(handler, verifyBuild, signal)\nproviders/gemini.ts:313\n\nconfigured = getConfiguredAppRuntimeMonitor(projectId);\nstate = await configured.monitor\n  .waitForSettledState(configured.ref);\n\nif (verifyBuild && state.status === \"running\") {\n  state = await validateFrontendBuild(...) ?? state;\n\n  if (state.status === \"running\") {\n    state = await validateFrontendQuality(\n      this.cwd || configured.ref.workspacePath\n    ) ?? state;\n  }\n}\n\nhandler.onChunk({\n  type: \"runtime\",\n  response: state\n});\nreturn state;",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "observeRuntime(handler, verifyBuild, signal)\nproviders/gemini.ts:313\n\nconfigured = getConfiguredAppRuntimeMonitor(projectId);\nstate = await configured.monitor\n  .waitForSettledState(configured.ref);\n\nif (verifyBuild && state.status === \"running\") {\n  state = await validateFrontendBuild(...) ?? state;\n\n  if (state.status === \"running\") {\n    state = await validateFrontendQuality(\n      this.cwd || configured.ref.workspacePath\n    ) ?? state;\n  }\n}\n\nhandler.onChunk({\n  type: \"runtime\",\n  response: state\n});\nreturn state;",
      "autoResize": false,
