      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AppRuntimeMonitor.waitForSettledState()\nruntime/AppRuntimeMonitor.ts\n\nfor up to 5 attempts:\n  state = await getState(ref)\n\n  terminal immediately:\n    running | crashed | not_found | unavailable\n\n  otherwise exponential backoff:\n    500ms → 1s → 2s → max 3s\n\ngetState(ref):\n  resolve latest active workspace pod\n  inspect container waiting/running/terminated state\n  classify application vs infrastructure failure\n  read current/previous logs for crashes\n  probe service or pod IP:\n    http://<service>.<namespace>.svc:5173\n      /workspace/<runtimeId>/\n    Host: project.tarun.co\n\nIf Running pod never becomes ready:\n  status = \"unhealthy\"\n  repairableByAgent = true",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AppRuntimeMonitor.waitForSettledState()\nruntime/AppRuntimeMonitor.ts\n\nfor up to 5 attempts:\n  state = await getState(ref)\n\n  terminal immediately:\n    running | crashed | not_found | unavailable\n\n  otherwise exponential backoff:\n    500ms → 1s → 2s → max 3s\n\ngetState(ref):\n  resolve latest active workspace pod\n  inspect container waiting/running/terminated state\n  classify application vs infrastructure failure\n  read current/previous logs for crashes\n  probe service or pod IP:\n    http://<service>.<namespace>.svc:5173\n      /workspace/<runtimeId>/\n    Host: project.tarun.co\n\nIf Running pod never becomes ready:\n  status = \"unhealthy\"\n  repairableByAgent = true",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
