      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "validateFrontendQuality()\nruntime/validateFrontendQuality.ts\n\nfiles = await listWorkspaceFiles(workspacePath);\n\nDeterministic checks:\n  no Vite starter markers\n  substantive CSS or UI system\n  reusable design tokens\n  responsive breakpoint/fluid intent\n  hover/focus/active states\n  grid/flex composition\n  horizontal rails only at narrow breakpoint\n\npass  → undefined (keep running state)\nfail  → unhealthy + repairableByAgent + logs\n\nImportant: global structural quality only;\nit does not judge whether the latest prompt was\nsatisfied by the latest diff.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "validateFrontendQuality()\nruntime/validateFrontendQuality.ts\n\nfiles = await listWorkspaceFiles(workspacePath);\n\nDeterministic checks:\n  no Vite starter markers\n  substantive CSS or UI system\n  reusable design tokens\n  responsive breakpoint/fluid intent\n  hover/focus/active states\n  grid/flex composition\n  horizontal rails only at narrow breakpoint\n\npass  → undefined (keep running state)\nfail  → unhealthy + repairableByAgent + logs\n\nImportant: global structural quality only;\nit does not judge whether the latest prompt was\nsatisfied by the latest diff.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
