      "updated": 1788084624106,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "mergeWorktree()  ·  subAgents/mergeWorktree.ts\n\nlet mergeChain = Promise.resolve();\n\nqueueMerge(merge):\n  result = mergeChain.then(merge);\n  mergeChain = result.then(noop, noop);\n  return result;\n\nInside queued merge:\n  git checkout main\n  git merge agent-<id>\n  git worktree remove ...\n  git branch -d ...\n\nOn conflict:\n  collect conflictingFiles\n  collect git status --short\n  collect stderr/stdout diagnostics\n  git merge --abort\n  preserve branch + worktree\n  return {\n    status: \"MERGE_CONFLICT\",\n    branchName, worktreePath,\n    conflictingFiles, gitStatus, error\n  }\n\nSub-agents run concurrently; only merges serialize.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "mergeWorktree()  ·  subAgents/mergeWorktree.ts\n\nlet mergeChain = Promise.resolve();\n\nqueueMerge(merge):\n  result = mergeChain.then(merge);\n  mergeChain = result.then(noop, noop);\n  return result;\n\nInside queued merge:\n  git checkout main\n  git merge agent-<id>\n  git worktree remove ...\n  git branch -d ...\n\nOn conflict:\n  collect conflictingFiles\n  collect git status --short\n  collect stderr/stdout diagnostics\n  git merge --abort\n  preserve branch + worktree\n  return {\n    status: \"MERGE_CONFLICT\",\n    branchName, worktreePath,\n    conflictingFiles, gitStatus, error\n  }\n\nSub-agents run concurrently; only merges serialize.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
