      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "8. Terminal completion gates  ·  gemini.ts:701\n\nA. Confirm net mutation:\ncurrentFingerprint = await fingerprintWorkspace(cwd);\nworkspaceChanged =\n  currentFingerprint !== initialFingerprint;\n\nB. Unfinished plan?\n  add reminder to newMessage;\n  hasToolCall = true;\n\nC. Outstanding delegates?\n  await collectRun(scope, \"all\");\n  add exact merge results to newMessage;\n  hasToolCall = true;\n\nD. If runtimeTouched:\n  observeRuntime(handler, true, signal);\n  // includes npm build + quality validation\n  repairable failure → newMessage; continue\n\nE. Only if terminal AND no workspace change:\n  requestIntent = await classifyRequestIntent(message);\n  mutationRequired = intent !== \"informational\";\n\nF. workspaceCompletionAction():\n  informational or changed → accept\n  missing required mutation, retries < 2 → retry\n  otherwise → fail\n\nG. Accepted terminal text:\n  rewriteCompletionMessageAgent(...)\n  emit { type: \"message\", response: finalMessage }",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "8. Terminal completion gates  ·  gemini.ts:701\n\nA. Confirm net mutation:\ncurrentFingerprint = await fingerprintWorkspace(cwd);\nworkspaceChanged =\n  currentFingerprint !== initialFingerprint;\n\nB. Unfinished plan?\n  add reminder to newMessage;\n  hasToolCall = true;\n\nC. Outstanding delegates?\n  await collectRun(scope, \"all\");\n  add exact merge results to newMessage;\n  hasToolCall = true;\n\nD. If runtimeTouched:\n  observeRuntime(handler, true, signal);\n  // includes npm build + quality validation\n  repairable failure → newMessage; continue\n\nE. Only if terminal AND no workspace change:\n  requestIntent = await classifyRequestIntent(message);\n  mutationRequired = intent !== \"informational\";\n\nF. workspaceCompletionAction():\n  informational or changed → accept\n  missing required mutation, retries < 2 → retry\n  otherwise → fail\n\nG. Accepted terminal text:\n  rewriteCompletionMessageAgent(...)\n  emit { type: \"message\", response: finalMessage }",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
