      "text": "classifyRequestIntent()\nproviders/gemini.ts + systemPrompts/intentClassifier.ts\n\nCalled only for a terminal no-change main-agent response.\n\ngenerateContent({\n  contents: JSON.stringify({ userMessage }),\n  responseMimeType: \"application/json\",\n  responseJsonSchema: {\n    intent:\n      \"implementation\" | \"informational\" | \"ambiguous\"\n  },\n  temperature: 0,\n  maxOutputTokens: 120,\n  abortSignal\n});\n\nambiguous is conservatively treated as mutation-required.\n\nworkspaceCompletionAction:\n  accept | retry | fail (max 2 no-change retries)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "classifyRequestIntent()\nproviders/gemini.ts + systemPrompts/intentClassifier.ts\n\nCalled only for a terminal no-change main-agent response.\n\ngenerateContent({\n  contents: JSON.stringify({ userMessage }),\n  responseMimeType: \"application/json\",\n  responseJsonSchema: {\n    intent:\n      \"implementation\" | \"informational\" | \"ambiguous\"\n  },\n  temperature: 0,\n  maxOutputTokens: 120,\n  abortSignal\n});\n\nambiguous is conservatively treated as mutation-required.\n\nworkspaceCompletionAction:\n  accept | retry | fail (max 2 no-change retries)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
