      "locked": false,
      "text": "rewriteCompletionMessageAgent()\nproviders/gemini.ts + systemPrompts/completionAgent.ts\n\ncompletionAgent.sendMessage({\n  userRequest,\n  draft: withheldTurnText,\n  verifiedFacts: {\n    workspaceChanged,\n    productionBuildAndPreviewHealthy: runtimeVerified\n  }\n});\n\nPrompt requires:\n  2–3 short sentences, max 80 words\n  lead with user-visible outcome\n  no file-by-file changelog\n  no invented features/tests/verification\n\nrawFinalOutput = original Gemini terminal text\nfinalOutput    = rewritten UI text",
      "fontSize": 15,
