      "text": "9. Persist terminal run  ·  gemini.ts:843\n\nif (runStatus === \"RUNNING\")\n  runStatus = \"SUCCEEDED\";\n\nawait prisma.conversationHistory.update({\n  where: { id: conversationRecord.id },\n  data: {\n    status: runStatus,\n    completed: true,\n    output: finalOutput || null,\n    rawOutput: rawFinalOutput || null,\n    errorMessage: runError\n  }\n});\n\nSub-agents return { id, status, summary } after\npersisting their own terminal row.",
