      "locked": false,
      "text": "contextualiseChat()\nproviders/gemini.ts → context/contextArchive.ts\n\narchiveLargeUpdateFileArguments(history, config):\n  deep clone via structuredClone(history)\n\n  for historical updateFile calls with\n  content.length > 150:\n    artifactId = sha256(content) + \".txt\"\n    write full content under:\n      <volume>/.sky-agent-context/<runtimeId>/\n    replace functionCall.args.content with:\n      [SKY_CONTEXT_ARTIFACT:<artifactId>]\n\nreadContextArtifact tool can load it later.\nreadFileContent should be used for current source.\n\nPurpose: retain exact old content without repeatedly\nsending large file bodies in the active Gemini history.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "contextualiseChat()\nproviders/gemini.ts → context/contextArchive.ts\n\narchiveLargeUpdateFileArguments(history, config):\n  deep clone via structuredClone(history)\n\n  for historical updateFile calls with\n  content.length > 150:\n    artifactId = sha256(content) + \".txt\"\n    write full content under:\n      <volume>/.sky-agent-context/<runtimeId>/\n    replace functionCall.args.content with:\n      [SKY_CONTEXT_ARTIFACT:<artifactId>]\n\nreadContextArtifact tool can load it later.\nreadFileContent should be used for current source.\n\nPurpose: retain exact old content without repeatedly\nsending large file bodies in the active Gemini history.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
