      "text": "History compaction + summarisation\nproviders/gemini.ts:885\n\nhistory = session.chat.getHistory();\ntokens = await geminiClient.models.countTokens(history);\n\nif tokens > 20,000:\n  newHistory = contextualiseChat(history);\n\n  if contextualiseCount >= 3:\n    sessionSummary = await summariseChat(\n      newHistory,\n      persistentSummary\n    );\n\n    prisma.agentMemory.upsert({\n      summary: sessionSummary,\n      summarizedThroughHistoryId: conversationRecord.id\n    });\n\n    createNewSession({\n      newSystemPrompt: sessionSummary\n      // old turns omitted\n    });\n  else:\n    createNewSession({\n      persistent summary + contextualized newHistory\n    });\n\nOn pod recreation:\n  restore summary\n  + successful raw user/model turns after high-water mark.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "History compaction + summarisation\nproviders/gemini.ts:885\n\nhistory = session.chat.getHistory();\ntokens = await geminiClient.models.countTokens(history);\n\nif tokens > 20,000:\n  newHistory = contextualiseChat(history);\n\n  if contextualiseCount >= 3:\n    sessionSummary = await summariseChat(\n      newHistory,\n      persistentSummary\n    );\n\n    prisma.agentMemory.upsert({\n      summary: sessionSummary,\n      summarizedThroughHistoryId: conversationRecord.id\n    });\n\n    createNewSession({\n      newSystemPrompt: sessionSummary\n      // old turns omitted\n    });\n  else:\n    createNewSession({\n      persistent summary + contextualized newHistory\n    });\n\nOn pod recreation:\n  restore summary\n  + successful raw user/model turns after high-water mark.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
