    {
      "id": "cancel-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1368,
      "y": 4836,
      "width": 784,
      "height": 478,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a072",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1072,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 18241,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788084624106,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "10. Cancellation / failure / cleanup\nproviders/gemini.ts:976\n\ncatch AgentRunCancelledError:\n  status = \"CANCELLED\"\n  completed = true\n  output = rawOutput = null\n  errorMessage = \"Generation stopped by user.\"\n  emit { type: \"stopped\" }\n  onFinish()\n\ncatch generic error:\n  persist status = \"FAILED\"\n  output = rawOutput = null\n  rethrow → SSE stream errors\n\nfinally:\n  subAgentRegistry.clearRun({\n    projectId,\n    parentRunId: conversationRecord.id\n  });\n\nSSE route finally:\n  abort controller if still active\n  agentRunRegistry.finish(projectId, controller)\n\nThis does not delete Kubernetes project resources.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "10. Cancellation / failure / cleanup\nproviders/gemini.ts:976\n\ncatch AgentRunCancelledError:\n  status = \"CANCELLED\"\n  completed = true\n  output = rawOutput = null\n  errorMessage = \"Generation stopped by user.\"\n  emit { type: \"stopped\" }\n  onFinish()\n\ncatch generic error:\n  persist status = \"FAILED\"\n  output = rawOutput = null\n  rethrow → SSE stream errors\n\nfinally:\n  subAgentRegistry.clearRun({\n    projectId,\n    parentRunId: conversationRecord.id\n  });\n\nSSE route finally:\n  abort controller if still active\n  agentRunRegistry.finish(projectId, controller)\n\nThis does not delete Kubernetes project resources.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
