    {
      "id": "legend-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2438,
      "y": 4276,
      "width": 1004,
      "height": 468,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a074",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1074,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 18275,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788084624106,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LEGEND / mental model\n\nBLUE    main request + Gemini continuation loop\nGREEN   tools, plans, input and intent helpers\nORANGE  runtime/build/quality/completion validation\nPURPLE  sessions, sub-agents and persistent memory\nRED     cancellation and failure ownership\nTEAL    filesystem evidence\n\nThe variable hasToolCall is the continuation flag.\nIt becomes true for:\n  • actual function calls\n  • runtime repair messages\n  • unfinished plans\n  • collected sub-agent results\n  • rejected no-change implementation responses\n\nThe loop finishes only when none of those remain\nand accepted terminal text is available.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LEGEND / mental model\n\nBLUE    main request + Gemini continuation loop\nGREEN   tools, plans, input and intent helpers\nORANGE  runtime/build/quality/completion validation\nPURPLE  sessions, sub-agents and persistent memory\nRED     cancellation and failure ownership\nTEAL    filesystem evidence\n\nThe variable hasToolCall is the continuation flag.\nIt becomes true for:\n  • actual function calls\n  • runtime repair messages\n  • unfinished plans\n  • collected sub-agent results\n  • rejected no-change implementation responses\n\nThe loop finishes only when none of those remain\nand accepted terminal text is available.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
